                                  "NOT_COMPUTED":  "Use when a result was not computed because prerequisites or authorization were absent; do not convert to a negative result.",
                                  "CHARACTERIZED":  "Use for bounded descriptive or mechanistic findings that do not establish broader effectiveness.",
                                  "CONTEXT_ONLY":  "Use for information useful to interpretation but not itself an evaluated AEGIS result.",
                                  "NOT_AUTHORIZED":  "Use for claims/evaluations explicitly outside the scientific authorization boundary."
